  "name": "verimina",
  "description": "A formal verification suite targeting the Mina blockchain protocol using the Isabelle/HOL proof assistant. It mechanizes the security properties of the Ouroboros family of consensus algorithms—specifically Samasika, Genesis, and Praos—alongside the logic governing Zero-Knowledge Applications (zkApps) and proof aggregation. The framework provides a rigorous foundation for reasoning about chain selection, succinct state transitions, and recursive cryptographic proofs.",
